== {{dlc+|r}} Tear Height ==
'''Tear height''' is a hidden attribute that determines the height that tears spawn at. Before Repentance, this was the range stat displayed in the found hud, and most items that affected range affected this stat directly. Since Repentance, most range affecting items affect the new [[range]] stat instead of tear height, and only a few items affect tear height directly. Tear height no longer majorly affects effective range.

